// ===========================================================================
// OBESITY — LAYERED version. The CONVENTION: RecordSet → Record → calculated.
//
// ⭐ ONE OF THREE LEGITIMATE AUTHORING OPTIONS (operator, 2026-08-29), and the
// one we expect to establish as the convention. Assume this is an Obesity
// LIBRARY consumed by other libraries, where every layer is used by something —
// so every layer is public, and the shape is functionally the union of the
// Record and RecordSet options.
//
// ⚠ It is NOT a straight union. The point of layering is that the lower layer
// is expressed ONCE and the upper layers REFER to it, rather than each layer
// restating the local `code is` and the `source representation`. Compare:
//
//   straight union   "Height" (Record) carries code + posrep + `most recent this`
//                    "Height Records" (RecordSet) carries code + posrep AGAIN
//   layered          "Height Records" carries code + posrep ONCE
//                    "Height" reduces it BY NAME — no code, no posrep, no repeat
//
// ⚠ CONSEQUENCE, measured and deliberate: the leaves stop being QUESTIONS. A
// question is a locally-coded concept publishing one record, and here the local
// code lives on the RecordSet (assertable, a history) while the reduction lives
// on an uncoded Record. So this option asks about `BMI` and `Obese` only.
// That is the trade the layering makes, not an oversight — see the driver test.
// ===========================================================================
library "Obesity Coverage (Layered)".

terminology "Obese VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/vitals/ValueSet/obese`.
terminology "Clinical BMI VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/vitals/ValueSet/bmi`.
terminology "Height VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/vitals/ValueSet/height`.
terminology "Weight VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/vitals/ValueSet/weight`.

// ── LAYER 1 — the HISTORIES ────────────────────────────────────────────────
// RecordSets. They carry the local code and the source representation, so they
// are assertable and they are the ONLY place that datum is described.

concept "Height Records":
- shape is RecordSet.
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity.
- code is `height`.
- source representation:
  - type is Observation.
  - coded from "Height VS".

concept "Weight Records":
- shape is RecordSet.
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity.
- code is `weight`.
- source representation:
  - type is Observation.
  - coded from "Weight VS".

// ── LAYER 2 — the SELECTED values ──────────────────────────────────────────
// Records reducing a NAMED history. No code, no posrep: the selection is the
// only thing these add, and it is stated once for every consumer downstream.

concept "Height":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity.
- definition is most recent "Height Records".

concept "Weight":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity.
- definition is most recent "Weight Records".

// ── LAYER 3 — CALCULATED ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Computed from the Records above, and separately recordable in its own right:
// the local code makes it assertable and answerable, the posrep admits externally
// recorded BMIs, and the reduction merges the arms.

concept "BMI":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity.
- code is `bmi`.
- definition is body mass index of "Weight" and "Height", then most recent this.
- source representation:
  - type is Observation.
  - coded from "Clinical BMI VS".

concept "Obese":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `obese`.
- definition is "BMI" at least 30 'kg/m2', then most recent this.
- source representation:
  - type is Condition.
  - coded from "Obese VS".
  - value projection is exists this.

activity "Approve Bariatric Surgery":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `APPROVED`.

activity "Deny Bariatric Surgery":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `NOT APPROVED`.

decision "Bariatric Surgery Coverage":
first:
- when "Obese" then recommend activity "Approve Bariatric Surgery".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Deny Bariatric Surgery".
